    {
      "type": "LinguisticObject",
      "content": "Joseph Haubrich (1889–1961), Cologne, until 1961; by descent within the Haubrich family; private collection, South America; sold Lempertz, Cologne, Nov. 30, 2012, lot 201, as Élégante de profil au bal Mabille, to a private collector, Paris. Talabardon et Gautier Gallery, Paris, by 2014; sold to the Art Institute of Chicago, 2014.",
